{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"一昨日は沈金でした"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゲスト\n21時台はCharisma.comさん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Charisma.comさんと\nフリースタイルのコーナーの奇跡のコラボ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも以上に\nラップ読むの緊張しましたね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつかさん、やっぱりかっこよかった～！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゴンチさんも無茶ぶりに応えてくださって\nありがとうございました！（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"22時台は\n乃木坂からちーちゃんとれなち"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人生を考えたくなる\n風船は生きている\nインフルエンサー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂の曲たくさん流せちゃったね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなのほぼType-Cじゃん！\n凄い！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2017/03/27/4040075/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむ復活ありがとう！おめでとう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか\nザキタウンなるものが生まれましたね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちーちゃん、れなち\n出演してくれてありがとう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"歴史的な回になったと思いますね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"聴いてくださったみなさん、ありがとうね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来週は\nそっ閉じのコーナーだよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なかだかな"}],"source":"archive"}